{%- comment -%}
  Buy area of the main product: the product form (variant id, quantity, add button with live total, dynamic checkout),
  the 'Mail me als dit weer op voorraad is' form (block setting notify_form: without an app it is the contact form, so the
  owner gets each request by mail and mails the shopper himself, docs/claims-to-confirm.md), or for a permanently
  discontinued product the alternatives.
  Params: product, block, section_id, form_id, current_variant, is_config, cfg, avail_status, is_discontinued,
  print_active, druk, is_maatwerk.

  assets/product-form.js (comments stripped there for the JS budget):
  - AJAX add via /cart/add.js with items[] (main product first, then the ticked add-ons, data-qty x the quantity unless
    data-addon-follow="false"); with a logo upload: multipart FormData, add-ons first and taken out again when the main
    product fails (all or nothing). A 422 'Je kunt maar 2 …' sets the quantity and says 'Er zijn er nog 2 op voorraad …'.
  - Live total on the button ('In mijn winkelwagen · €798,00') and in the sticky bar; the sticky label follows the button
    (pre-order / uitverkocht) and its variant line says what the total holds ('2 st. · 3 × 3 m / Rood + 1 extra'). Add-on
    rows show '3 × €199,00 + €597,00' when they follow the quantity. The button label is updated in place (text nodes), as
    new nodes between mousedown and mouseup (a typed quantity commits on blur) would swallow the click.
  - Variant change: the add-on rows take the new variant's add-on variants at once (variants JSON 'ad', same product or
    same type: polyester side walls become the PVC set), the error notice is cleared, and a buy click before the section
    HTML arrives waits for it (label 'Toevoegen…'; after 8 s it adds with the swapped add-ons), so an add-on of the
    previous variant never lands in the cart. Ticks carry over into the fresh add-on list, also across a sold-out variant
    (which shows no add-ons): the last ticks are remembered until a variant with add-ons comes back.
  - Staffel: tier buttons set the quantity; the hint compares quote and cart price in quote mode (never a cart discount).
  - 'Nog x tonen' for add-ons beyond the block's visible count; a ticked add-on is never hidden.
  - Sticky bar: once the main button has scrolled out above the header (phones: a bar; from 990 px a floating card while
    scrolling back up), never before the options were seen and never next to the main button (brand 4.2); the total
    carries 'excl. btw' in Zakelijk mode; a keyboard-focused element (:focus-visible, not a tap that focuses <main>) is
    scrolled clear of it (WCAG 2.4.11).
  - Inline offerte and stock-alert forms: Dutch validation messages (form/field data-msg-required, data-msg-email), and
    after the post the confirmation ([data-form-success]) is scrolled into view and focused, so it is read out.

  'Meerdere kleuren tegelijk bestellen' (block setting mix_min, default 10 colours; not for print, configurator or 'set'):
  a link under the buy button. The first click loads assets/product-mix.js (product-form.js only appends the script, so
  pages without the panel pay nothing), which loads product-mix.css, fills the panel from its <template> (above the
  button: one stepper per colour for the chosen Maat / Uitvoering) and opens it. While it is open:
  - the main quantity stepper hides; the button total, the staffel hint ('quantity' = all colours together), the sticky
    bar and the offerte 'Aantal' count every colour; '12 stuks in 3 kleuren' under the grid (role=status);
  - one /cart/add.js call adds a line per colour plus the ticked add-ons per colour (each colour's own add-on variant
    from the variants JSON 'ad': a topcover in the same colour; add-ons that go once per order stay once);
  - a colour that is not available in the chosen Maat / Uitvoering is disabled and struck through; deny-policy stock caps
    its stepper; changing Maat or Uitvoering re-maps every colour;
  - the drawer says 'Statafelrok stretch, Ø 80–85 cm · Met topcover · 3 kleuren · 12 ×'.
  'Terug naar één kleur' closes it and restores the normal form.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if is_discontinued -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign alts = product.metafields.custom.alternatieven.value
    if alts == blank
      assign alts = product.metafields.custom.past_op.value
    endif
  -%}
  <div class="discontinued" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <div class="notice notice--info">
      {%- render 'icon', icon: 'info' -%}
      <div><strong>{{ 'product.status_discontinued' | t }}</strong>{{ 'product.status_discontinued_text' | t }}</div>
    </div>
    {%- if alts != blank -%}
      <p class="discontinued__title">{{ 'product.status_alternatives' | t }}</p>
      <ul class="mini-cards" role="list">
        {%- for a in alts limit: 3 -%}
          <li>
            <a class="mini-card" href="{{ a.url }}">
              <span class="mini-card__media">{%- if a.featured_media -%}{{ a.featured_media.preview_image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '', widths: '80, 160', sizes: '72px' }}{%- endif -%}</span>
              <span class="mini-card__body">
                <span class="mini-card__title">{{ a.title }}</span>
                {%- if a.metafields.custom.kenmerk_kort != blank -%}<span class="mini-card__spec">{{ a.metafields.custom.kenmerk_kort.value }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                {%- render 'price', product: a -%}
              </span>
              {%- render 'icon', icon: 'chevron-right', class: 'icon--sm' -%}
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- else -%}
<product-form class="buy" data-form-id="{{ form_id }}" data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, class: 'buy__form', novalidate: 'novalidate', data-product-form: 'main' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      One id field. Without JavaScript the radios (outside the form) cannot set it, so it is a visible
      select of all variants; with JavaScript it is hidden and variant-picker.js keeps it in sync.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if product.has_only_default_variant -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}" data-variant-id>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="field buy__variant-select no-js-only">
        <label class="field__label" for="VariantSelect-{{ section_id }}">{{ 'product.variant_select' | t }}</label>
        <select class="select" id="VariantSelect-{{ section_id }}" name="id" data-variant-id>
          {%- for v in product.variants -%}
            <option value="{{ v.id }}"{% if v.id == current_variant.id %} selected{% endif %}>{{ v.title }} – {{ v.price | money }}{% unless v.available %} ({{ 'product.sold_out' | t }}){% endunless %}</option>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </select>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- liquid
      # 'Meerdere kleuren' (block setting mix_min): a product whose colour option has at least that many values (a
      # 24-colour statafelrok) can be ordered as a mix, '6 × Zwart + 4 × Wit', in one click on the same buy button.
      # Not for print (one logo upload per line), configurator or bundle products ('set': a mix inside one pakket is not
      # what the panel does). The panel (template) and assets/product-mix.js + product-mix.css load on the first click.
      assign mix_opt = nil
      assign mix_min = block.settings.mix_min | default: 0
      assign mix_print = false
      if product.metafields.custom.bedrukbaar.value == true or product.tags contains 'bedrukbaar'
        assign mix_print = true
      endif
      if mix_min > 1 and is_config == false and mix_print == false and product.has_only_default_variant == false
        unless product.tags contains 'set'
          assign mix_names = settings.swatch_option_names | downcase | split: ','
          for option in product.options_with_values
            assign mo = option.name | downcase | strip
            for n in mix_names
              assign nn = n | strip
              if nn == mo and option.values.size >= mix_min
                assign mix_opt = option
                assign mix_idx = forloop.parentloop.index0
              endif
            endfor
          endfor
        endunless
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if mix_opt -%}
      {%- assign mix_n = mix_opt.values.size -%}
      <div class="mix js-only" data-mix data-mix-index="{{ mix_idx }}" data-css="{{ 'product-mix.css' | asset_url }}" data-empty="{{ 'product.mix_empty' | t | escape }}" data-count-one="{{ 'product.mix_count.one' | t: count: 1 | replace: '1', '__COUNT__' | escape }}" data-count-other="{{ 'product.mix_count.other' | t: count: '__COUNT__' | escape }}" data-col-one="{{ 'product.mix_colours.one' | t: count: 1 | replace: '1', '__COUNT__' | escape }}" data-col-other="{{ 'product.mix_colours.other' | t: count: '__COUNT__' | escape }}" data-sum="{{ 'product.mix_sum' | t: count: '__COUNT__', colours: '__COLOURS__' | escape }}">
        <div class="mix__body" id="Mix-{{ section_id }}" role="group" aria-labelledby="MixTitle-{{ section_id }}" data-mix-body hidden></div>
        <template>
          <div class="mix__head">
            <p class="mix__title" id="MixTitle-{{ section_id }}">{{ 'product.mix_heading' | t }} <span class="mix__ctx" data-mix-ctx></span></p>
            <button type="button" class="link mix__clear" data-mix-clear hidden>{{ 'product.mix_clear' | t }}</button>
          </div>
          {%- if product.metafields.custom.staffelkorting.value.size > 0 -%}<p class="mix__note">{{ 'product.mix_note' | t }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <ul class="mix__grid" role="list">
            {%- for value in mix_opt.values -%}
              {%- capture mix_sw -%}{%- render 'swatch', value: value, mode: 'css' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
              <li class="mix__cell" data-mix-value="{{ value | escape }}">
                <label class="mix__name" for="Mix-{{ section_id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><span class="swatch" style="{{ mix_sw }}"></span><span>{{ value }}</span></label>
                <quantity-input class="qty qty--sm mix__qty">
                  <button type="button" class="qty__btn" name="minus" aria-label="{{ 'product.mix_less' | t: value: value | escape }}">{%- render 'icon', icon: 'minus', class: 'icon--sm' -%}</button>
                  <input class="qty__input" type="number" inputmode="numeric" id="Mix-{{ section_id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" value="0" min="0" step="1">
                  <button type="button" class="qty__btn" name="plus" aria-label="{{ 'product.mix_more' | t: value: value | escape }}">{%- render 'icon', icon: 'plus', class: 'icon--sm' -%}</button>
                </quantity-input>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
          <p class="mix__sum" data-mix-sum role="status"></p>
        </template>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="buy__row" data-dynamic="buy">
      {%- if is_config -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="{{ cfg.min_afname | default: 1 }}" data-config-qty>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign qty_id = 'Quantity-' | append: section_id
          # tracked stock that cannot be oversold (policy deny): the stepper stops at the stock, a typed higher number
          # is set back with 'Er zijn er nog 6 op voorraad. We hebben je aantal aangepast.' (product-form.js)
          assign q_max = current_variant.quantity_rule.max
          if current_variant.inventory_management == 'shopify' and current_variant.inventory_policy == 'deny' and current_variant.inventory_quantity > 0
            if q_max == blank or current_variant.inventory_quantity < q_max
              assign q_max = current_variant.inventory_quantity
            endif
          endif
        -%}
        <div class="buy__qty" data-buy-qty{% unless current_variant.available %} hidden{% endunless %}>
          {%- render 'quantity-input', id: qty_id, min: current_variant.quantity_rule.min, step: current_variant.quantity_rule.increment, max: q_max, value: current_variant.quantity_rule.min -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- liquid
        # 'Nu bestellen, later leveren' only for custom.availability_status 'pre-order' (CONTRACT). A plain backorder
        # (stock 0, policy continue), a lead time (custom.levertijd) or made to order keeps 'In mijn winkelwagen': the
        # delivery block right under the button states the lead time and the expected delivery date.
        assign is_preorder = false
        if avail_status == 'pre-order' and current_variant.available
          assign is_preorder = true
        endif
        assign is_coming = false
        if avail_status == 'binnenkort' and current_variant.available == false
          assign is_coming = true
        endif
      -%}
      <button type="submit" name="add" class="btn btn--buy btn--block buy__add" data-add-button data-price="{{ current_variant.price }}" data-preorder="{{ is_preorder }}"{% if is_maatwerk %} aria-describedby="Maatwerk-{{ section_id }}"{% endif %}{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>
        {%- render 'icon', icon: 'cart', class: 'icon--sm buy__icon' -%}
        {%- render 'icon', icon: 'check', class: 'icon--sm buy__icon-done' -%}
        <span data-add-label>
          {%- if is_coming -%}
            {{ 'product.status_coming' | t }}
          {%- elsif current_variant.available == false -%}
            {{ 'product.sold_out' | t }}
          {%- elsif is_preorder -%}
            {{ 'product.pre_order' | t }}
          {%- else -%}
            {{ 'product.add_to_cart' | t }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </span>
      </button>
    </div>
    {%- if mix_opt -%}
      {%- comment -%} under the button, so the first screen keeps its button; the panel opens above the button {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign mx_a = mix_n | times: 3 | divided_by: 10 -%}{%- assign mx_b = mix_n | divided_by: 2 -%}{%- assign mx_c = mix_n | times: 4 | divided_by: 5 -%}
      <style>.mix__toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;font-weight:var(--p6);text-align:left;>[data-mix-label]{text-decoration:underline 1.5px;text-underline-offset:3px}}.mix__dots{display:flex;padding-left:7px;.swatch{--size:20px;margin-left:-7px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--c-zand)}}</style>
      <button type="button" class="mix__toggle js-only" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="Mix-{{ section_id }}" data-mix-toggle data-js="{{ 'product-mix.js' | asset_url }}">
        <span class="mix__dots" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- for i in (0..2) -%}
            {%- case i -%}{%- when 0 -%}{%- assign mx_i = mx_a -%}{%- when 1 -%}{%- assign mx_i = mx_b -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign mx_i = mx_c -%}{%- endcase -%}
            {%- capture mx_sw -%}{%- render 'swatch', value: mix_opt.values[mx_i], mode: 'css' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            <span class="swatch" style="{{ mx_sw }}"></span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </span>
        <span data-mix-label>{{ 'product.mix_toggle' | t }}</span><span data-mix-label hidden>{{ 'product.mix_back' | t }}</span>
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if block.settings.show_dynamic_checkout and is_config == false -%}{{ form | payment_button }}{%- endif -%}
    <p class="notice notice--warn buy__note" role="status" data-qty-note data-tpl="{{ 'cart.quantity_adjusted' | t: count: '__COUNT__' | escape }}" hidden></p>
    <p class="notice notice--error buy__error" role="alert" data-form-error data-stock-tpl="{{ 'cart.quantity_adjusted' | t: count: '__COUNT__' | escape }}" hidden></p>
  {%- endform -%}
  <div data-dynamic="notify">
    {%- unless current_variant.available or block.settings.notify_form == false -%}
      {%- assign notify_id = 'Notify-' | append: section_id -%}
      {%- assign n_msg_req = 'forms.error_required_email' | t -%}
      {%- assign n_msg_email = 'forms.error_email' | t -%}
      {%- form 'contact', id: notify_id, class: 'notify', data-msg-required: n_msg_req, data-msg-email: n_msg_email -%}
        {%- comment -%} contact[id] tells this form's post apart from the offerte form on the same page {%- endcomment -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[id]" value="{{ notify_id }}">
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? and form.id == notify_id -%}
          <p class="notice notice--success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-form-success>{%- render 'icon', icon: 'check' -%}<span>{{ 'product.notify_success' | t }}</span></p>
        {%- else -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Onderwerp]" value="{{ 'product.notify_title' | t | escape }}">
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Product]" value="{{ product.title | escape }}{% unless product.has_only_default_variant %} – {{ current_variant.title | escape }}{% endunless %} ({{ current_variant.sku }})">
          {%- if form.errors and form.id == notify_id -%}<p class="notice notice--error" role="alert">{%- render 'icon', icon: 'alert' -%}<span>{{ 'forms.error_email' | t }}</span></p>{%- endif -%}
          <label class="field__label" for="NotifyEmail-{{ section_id }}">{{ 'product.notify_title' | t }}</label>
          <div class="notify__row">
            <input class="input" type="email" id="NotifyEmail-{{ section_id }}" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="{{ 'newsletter.label' | t }}">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">{{ 'product.notify_button' | t }}</button>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  </div>
</product-form>
{%- endif -%}
